{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtas790607swroamcmunq53y","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmtas790607swroamcmunq53y","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtas790607swroamcmunq53y","published_at":"2026-08-27T00:20:11Z","ref":"A1","score":75,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家（RSS）","summary":"英伟达预计 2028 财年销售额同比增长约 70%，CEO 黄仁勋称实际市场需求远高于这一数字，增速主要受供应能力限制。公司同时宣布将在 2027 至 2028 年向 AWS 额外供应 200 万块 GPU。第二季度营收同比增长 106% 至 962.2 亿美元，连续第 13 个季度创下营收纪录。","title":"英伟达预计 2028 财年营收同比增 70%，黄仁勋称实际需求远高于此","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/994/807.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtar8e770746roam1wznm4mi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmtar8e770746roam1wznm4mi","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtar8e770746roam1wznm4mi","published_at":"2026-08-26T23:47:18Z","ref":"A2","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"亚马逊与英伟达宣布扩大合作，将在2027和2028年为AWS数据中心新增200万颗GPU芯片，包括Blackwell Ultra、Rubin和Rubin Ultra。此前五个月亚马逊刚同意部署超100万颗英伟达GPU，英伟达称此后\"需求超出预期\"。双方未披露财务条款，但按GPU单价估算交易价值达数百亿美元。","title":"亚马逊将英伟达芯片订单增至三倍，新增200万颗GPU","title_en":"Amazon just tripled its order of Nvidia chips over 'surging demand'","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/26/amazon-just-tripled-its-order-of-nvidia-chips-over-surging-demand"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaq20ih062wroamdrhb54b6","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmtaq20ih062wroamdrhb54b6","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaq20ih062wroamdrhb54b6","published_at":"2026-08-26T20:25:54Z","ref":"A3","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家（RSS）","summary":"英伟达发布 2027 财年半年报，上半年营收 1778.37 亿美元，归母净利润 1180.1 亿美元，同比增长 161.1%，GAAP 毛利率 75%。第二财季营收 962.21 亿美元，同比增长 106%，环比增长 18%，归母净利润 596.88 亿美元，同比增长 126%。数据中心业务第二季度收入 890.23 亿美元，同比增长 117%，Vera Rubin 平台已进入全面量产。","title":"英伟达 2027 财年半年报归母净利润 1180.1 亿美元，同比增长 161.1%","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/994/791.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaj3732034urovudls0byfe","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmtaj3732034urovudls0byfe","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaj3732034urovudls0byfe","published_at":"2026-08-26T20:10:19.416000Z","ref":"A4","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","summary":"Google Research 推出 GlucoFM，一款轻量级自监督 CGM 基础模型，采用双流设计分别建模缓慢血糖趋势与短期波动。在四个队列、七项临床预测任务的 14 项评估中，其 PR-AUC 较最优 GluFormer 变体平均高出 5.8 个百分点，并在 PPGR 预测中取得最低 MAE。模型在 109，066 小时无标注 CGM 数据上预训练，具备跨数据集迁移与少样本适应能力。","title":"GlucoFM：面向连续血糖监测的基础模型","title_en":"GlucoFM： Foundation model for continuous glucose monitoring","url":"https://research.google/blog/glucofm-foundation-model-for-continuous-glucose-monitoring"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaej1vz0czhroj2aybdbq26","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmtaej1vz0czhroj2aybdbq26","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaej1vz0czhroj2aybdbq26","published_at":"2026-08-26T18:02:41.262000Z","ref":"A5","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：Blog（网页）","summary":"Anthropic 宣布 Claude in Chrome 现已面向所有付费 Claude 套餐全面开放，Claude 可在浏览器中自主执行操作，无需逐步审批。系统通过安全分类器在每次操作前验证其安全性及是否符合用户请求，并强化了针对提示注入攻击的防御。最新评测显示，在启用探测与安全分类器后，自 Opus 4.8 起的所有模型均未出现攻击成功案例。","title":"Claude in Chrome 正式全面上线","title_en":"Claude in Chrome is generally available","url":"https://claude.com/blog/claude-in-chrome-generally-available"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaddncd0aq0roj2xmay0scj","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmtaddncd0aq0roj2xmay0scj","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtaddncd0aq0roj2xmay0scj","published_at":"2026-08-26T17:30:30.074000Z","ref":"A6","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","summary":"Anthropic 今年春季启动试点，通过隐私保护工具 Anthropic Insights（原 Clio）向斯坦福大学 SALT Lab、牛津大学人类信息处理实验室及 METR 三个外部机构开放约 25 万段 2026 年 4-5 月的 Claude.ai 或 Claude Code 对话数据，供其独立设计研究并公开发布结果。","title":"Anthropic 开放 Claude 真实使用数据供外部独立研究，公布试点结果","title_en":"Enabling independent research on how people use Claude","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/enabling-independent-research"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtacdvh50a4aroj2zlw9jnj9","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmtacdvh50a4aroj2zlw9jnj9","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtacdvh50a4aroj2zlw9jnj9","published_at":"2026-08-26T17:02:40.777000Z","ref":"A7","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：Blog（网页）","summary":"Warp 在 Claude 平台上构建了基于 Agent Skills 的自我改进循环，通过基础技能与改进技能两个文件型技能，将人类反馈转化为对智能体的持续优化。该模式已应用于其整个开源仓库，覆盖数百名贡献者与数千次代码审查。团队建议以原则而非规则编写技能，并强调低摩擦反馈与改进技能的可复用性。","title":"Warp 如何在 Claude 上构建自我改进的智能体","title_en":"How Warp builds self-improving agents on Claude","url":"https://claude.com/blog/how-warp-builds-self-improving-agents-on-claude"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtacq8vz0aedroj24bcix9go","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmtacq8vz0aedroj24bcix9go","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtacq8vz0aedroj24bcix9go","published_at":"2026-08-26T17:01:00Z","ref":"A8","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"Google DeepMind：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Google DeepMind 推出 Gemini 3.5 Transcribe 语音转文本模型，支持流式与非流式两种 API。据 Artificial Analysis 评测，其流式与非流式平均词错率分别为 4.0% 和 2.6%，支持超 85 种语言、自定义词汇及最多三人说话人识别。","title":"Gemini 3.5 Transcribe 发布：面向实时语音交互的高精度语音转文本模型","title_en":"Intelligent transcription with Gemini 3.5 Transcribe","url":"https://deepmind.google/blog/intelligent-transcription-with-gemini-3-5-transcribe"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta9ciqt07c1roj219h5liie","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmta9ciqt07c1roj219h5liie","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta9ciqt07c1roj219h5liie","published_at":"2026-08-26T15:32:46Z","ref":"A9","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"X：通义千问 / Qwen (@Alibaba_Qwen)","summary":"通义千问发布 Qwen3.8-Flash，一款多模态 MoE 模型，作为 Qwen4 架构的早期预览并开放权重。该模型总参数 125B，每 token 仅激活 6B，训练成本仅为 Qwen3.7-Plus 的 1/9，性能全面超越后者。生产版 API 定价 $0.16/1M 输入 tokens 和 $0.47/1M 输出 tokens，原生上下文 262K，可扩展至 1M。","title":"Qwen3.8-Flash 开源，Qwen4 架构预览","title_en":"API is live on QwenCloud： https://www.qwencloud.com/models/qwen3.8-flash 🙌Let's build something！","url":"https://x.com/Alibaba_Qwen/status/2092636376990990503"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta7bh1k04u6roj2e4pt7bob","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmta7bh1k04u6roj2e4pt7bob","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta7bh1k04u6roj2e4pt7bob","published_at":"2026-08-26T14:11:33Z","ref":"A10","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：智谱（GLM）","summary":"智谱上线并开源 GLM-5.3-Flash（320B-A18B），这是 GLM-5 系列首个原生多模态模型，AA 综合智能指数 57 分，与 Claude Opus 4.8 持平。其定价为 GLM-5.3 的 1/10，限时折扣内为 Opus 4.8 的 1/40，并已接入 ZCode 等平台开放 API 调用。该模型采用稀疏注意力与线性注意力混合架构，推理服务已跑在国产芯片集群上。","title":"GLM-5.3-Flash 开源：320B 总参数、AA 指数 57 分，定价为 Opus 4.8 的 1/40","title_en":"GLM-5.3-Flash：前沿智能进入普惠时代","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzI3NzQ0Mg%3D%3D&mid=2247494157&idx=1&sn=6837b15a07d2518842eb6c6b53a3eb3c"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta6v56y03yiroj2ki26viqh","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmta6v56y03yiroj2ki26viqh","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta6v56y03yiroj2ki26viqh","published_at":"2026-08-26T14:05:28.706000Z","ref":"A11","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","summary":"一个打着\"汉诺威公共政策研究所\"旗号的亲以色列网站，在九天内发布了124篇、超56万字的报告，旨在优化内容以引导ChatGPT等AI聊天机器人引用其亲以观点。该网站由美国公司Piro Inc依据《外国代理人登记法》为以色列政府分发内容，其背后是以色列政府数千万美元资助、经Havas Media等第三方转手的更广泛宣传行动。","title":"以色列资助的假美国智库试图利用AI进行宣传","title_en":"一个由以色列设立并资助的假美国智库，试图利用人工智能进行宣传","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/26/fake-thinktank-israel-ai-propaganda"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta6v56y03ytroj25ggn7rlo","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmta6v56y03ytroj25ggn7rlo","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta6v56y03ytroj25ggn7rlo","published_at":"2026-08-26T14:05:27.506000Z","ref":"A12","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","summary":"安全研究员David Buchanan指出，C2PA相机认证在Android平台上可被攻破。通过root权限提升漏洞（如CVE-2026-43499），攻击者可利用StrongBox硬件签名任意数据，伪造C2PA签名图像和视频，且无需硬件攻击。该问题无法通过常规补丁修复，已提前90天向相关方报告。","title":"C2PA相机经不起现实的考验：Android端可被root攻击伪造签名","title_en":"C2PA相机经不起现实的考验","url":"https://www.da.vidbuchanan.co.uk/blog/android-c2pa.html"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta2veap03nmrolwxllvp4ay","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmta2veap03nmrolwxllvp4ay","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta2veap03nmrolwxllvp4ay","published_at":"2026-08-26T12:30:00Z","ref":"A13","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Qwen：Blog Retrieval（API）","summary":"通义千问开源 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，一款多模态 MoE 模型，也是 Qwen4 架构的早期预览。该模型采用 GDN + QSA 混合注意力等四项升级，总参数 125B，每 token 激活 6B，训练成本约为 Qwen3.7-Plus 的 1/9，编码与办公任务能力更强。","title":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 开源：Qwen4 架构早期预览","title_en":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next： A New Architecture， Towards Ultimate Cost-Efficiency","url":"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen3.8-flash-next"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta7fyl104z5roj2ancsmx4g","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmta7fyl104z5roj2ancsmx4g","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta7fyl104z5roj2ancsmx4g","published_at":"2026-08-26T08:27:00Z","ref":"A14","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：卡尔的AI沃茨","summary":"豆包工作（豆包 Work）是当前企业接入Agent门槛最低的路径，但需用飞书账号登录才能解锁满血功能。实测可用手机远程控制最多7台设备、定时任务、自动读取本地skill、侧边栏直接编辑并同步飞书，且管理员看不到聊天记录。作者认为Work Agent是token消耗倍增器，飞书原生生态是豆包工作相比Claude Cowork、Codex Work的核心优势。","title":"实测飞书和豆包合体后第1个Agent：豆包工作的8个使用技巧","title_en":"实测飞书和豆包合体后第1个Agent，我挖到了豆包工作的8个使用技巧","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MTk3NzYzNw%3D%3D&mid=2247509950&idx=1&sn=18e7ecdceb66058f5ae1681009b4054e"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmta7honk0553roj21gque0zw","source":"AIHOT"},"categor